        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "For two days and two nights, I haven't seen a single soul...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which... which way is Lungmen? Which way is home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad, Mom... I'm thirsty... I'm tired...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are those... buildings, afar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm almost there... don't fall asleep...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "65_g7_filmandtvstudio",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$comedy_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Wonderful, Nyamu! That's exactly the feeling I was going for!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "text": "An ordinary village girl leaves everything behind on a journey to pursue her musical dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "text": "This scene is her darkest moment. After this, a serendipitous encounter sets her on the path to becoming Lungmen's favorite musician.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Appreciate the compliment, D~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dunno why, but when I read the script, I found myself really identifying with the heroine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course! It was tailor-written just for you, Miss Nyamu!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Shangshu dialect* Yeah right... like we didn't rewrite it in a rush to make the New Year screening...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The investors saw the success of <i>The Drummer Girl</i> and demanded we cast you for the lead role.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then your agency wanted the movie out for the New Year screening, so the director here made me rewrite the script in a week...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the original ending... the girl was meant to have this phantasmagoric dream in her dying moments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Under a blaze of dazzling lights, an unremarkable girl staggered her way onto the awards podium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "There, in her dream, she finally won everyone's recognition and made peace with everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what the ending was supposed to be! A savage, ironic satire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Ding nei goh fai</i>, you think that trash you wrote would've got funding like this without Nyamu's name value?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a shake about your funding? You've been kissing sponsors' asses for so long, you've forgotten how to make art!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stories like this just don't come true! Ordinary people never just get the chance to step into the spotlight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*Shangshu dialect* You don't know that because you're not from the countryside! Well, I am, and I know!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll show you, third-rate hack writer\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punchsp5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch02",
        "delay": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "delay": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 25,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They close the distance, and the war of words turns physical."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guys, you could talk this out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch02"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I've always wanted to strangle you for those garbage shots of yours, <i>ri ni xian ren ban ban!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scriptwriter"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Puk gaai</i>, you just see, you're the first one I kick out the door when I get rich!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Director"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello?? Can you not\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
