    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1260_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hospital called. Director and scriptwriter got put in the same ward. In facing beds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Both of them are in neck braces though, so all they do is stare at each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, this means we can't shoot for a while...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I haven't had a proper break in a hot minute. I'd say this is a silver lining for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1260_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll contact you once we nail down an upcoming shoot schedule for you. Just be on standby until then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mutters) Man, I don't know why, but that's a weight off my shoulders...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, I can't relax yet\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mom...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_trnpndor",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rooftop_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl picks up her phone, slides the balcony door open and steps outside."
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'eat dinner yet, Nyamu? Y'all busy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure I ate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Us folks at home been having a great year for wheat. Out'n the fields afore sunup, harvestin' away till sundown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Y'all don't listen when I tell ya, huh? Take it easy, slow down. Enjoy country livin'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jus' don't want you to go wearin' yourself too thin, sweetie. Y'get weary out there, come home and take a break.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, sweetie, whaddya wanna eat for the holidays? Me and Dad'll whip you up somethin'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ain't makin' it back for the holidays, c'mon! I'm always busiest when everyone else ain't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "That so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Distant voice) Mom, y'got Sis on the phone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sound of running)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sis! We saw the trailer for your new movie on TV!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad there ain't any theaters around here. We wanna buy your tickets!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh, hey, no sweat. I'll send y'all a copy when they print the discs!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yay\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look so cool in the movie, playin' on the drums!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm startin' to learn drums too. Been usin' your old set to practice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Betcha been gettin' mad crazy at the drums now, right? I wanna perform on stage one day just like you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... heheh, been a li'l busy lately, ain't had time to practice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm no slacker, no way! You'n me, let's knock 'em dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bet! Okay, Mom's yellin' at us to go to bed. You sleep soon, Sis!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'all take care a'yerselves! Night!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "G'night!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
