        "key": "$d_avg_phonestop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_ringoff",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Nyamu, the agency just received an offer for you from a major variety show.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Recording starts tomorrow at 8pm, and it's slated to run into the early morning. Are you available?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's sudden, wouldn't you say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... the other guest they're inviting on is Miss Sora. The idol girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's about even with you in terms of fanbase, and she's well-regarded both inside and outside the industry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a great opportunity for exposure, and I know the schedule's a little tight, but the agency would really love for you to be on the show...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, tell them\u2014Nyamu's looking forward to working with them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Great. That's a wrap for today, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good night, Miss Nyamu. Sweet dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on the Phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...Well, at least I'm getting sleep tonight.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
