    {
        "text": "She looks up at the digital clock on her coffee table. It reads '00:23'."
    },
    {
        "text": "She flops hard on the sofa, letting it envelop her as she sinks snugly in."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How many months since I practiced last...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nyamu drags herself out, and over to the electronic drum set. A thin layer of dust has already formed on the cymbals."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Where'd my sticks go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She has almost forgotten the last time she held a drum stick."
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it at home? Or on the set of <i>The Drummer Girl</i>, even longer ago?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Screw it. See what's on TV, then call it a day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
