    {
        "text": "Hello to all my fans! Fresh new talent Nyamu here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just starred in <i>The Drummer Girl,</i> airing in theaters now! It's a super intriguing movie, and I hope you'll all see it on the big screen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
